# Escape needs "four or more card types" among the OTHER cards exiled from the graveyard (the Nethergoyf's own creature type does
# not count). Bot1's Entombs put an Entomb (instant), the Nethergoyf and an Ornithopter (artifact, creature) in the graveyard: three
# types among the others (the Black Lotus sacrificed for mana is an artifact too), so the escape is not offered (refused). A third Entomb adds an Island (land): four, and on turn 3 the
# Nethergoyf escapes, exiling the Entomb, Ornithopter and Island. The two other Entombs and the sacrificed Black Lotus stay: instant and artifact, a 2/3.

